{"id":"steam-1016900","steam":1016900,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"GUN AND BUCKLER","summary":"Shoot and deflect bullets as a frog equipped with a gun, a buckler and a sticky tongue.","about":"Shoot and deflect bullets as a frog equipped with a gun, a buckler and a sticky tongue.\r\n\r\nGUN & BUCKLER is a lucrative blood-sport set some time in the future – a branch growing off the long tradition of frog breeding, introducing a new generation of frogs that understand how to use weapons.\r\n\r\nThe game puts you into the action of being pitted against your genetic peers and their freaky deviations, at the amusement of national TV, at the profit of the breeders and at the detriment of countless clones of frogs and toads.\r\n\r\nYour job is to make sure you never get hit by a bullet. Don't get hit. You will die, don't do it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGameplay features:\r\n\n\r\n•  Aim 360 degrees around you\r\n•  Switch between blocking and shooting\r\n•  Crouch first to jump high like a frog\r\n•  Walljumps, climbing and sliding off walls\r\n•  Fast swimming\r\n•  Grab items, other frogs and steal their items using your TONGUE. You can dual wield.\r\n•  Directional melee attacks\r\n\n\r\n\r\nOther features:\r\n\n\r\n•  Several arenas\r\n•  Play vs other players or bots, locally or online\r\n•  Controller support\r\n•  Tutorials and training\r\n•  Character customization and profiles","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016900/library_600x900.jpg?t=1685107965","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016900/header.jpg?t=1685107965","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016900/library_hero.jpg?t=1685107965","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016900/header.jpg?t=1685107965","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016900/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1685107965"